<title>MALAYSIA: Bank Negara's reserves increase to 67.87 bln rgt.</title>
<headline>Bank Negara's reserves increase to 67.87 bln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Negara's gold, foreign exchange and other reserves increased to 67.87 billion ringgit as at September 30, 1996 compared with 67.6 billion a fortnight earlier, the Bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The central bank said its total assets and liabilities fell to 94.99 billion ringgit from 95.17 billion two weeks earlier.</p>
<p>(In bln rgt)    Sept 30,1996    Sept 14,1996     Sept 15,1995</p>
<p>Reserves	    67.87	     67.60		66.50</p>
<p>Assets		94.99	     95.17		92.64</p>
<p>Currency	    19.97	     19.80		17.60</p>
<p>Govt paper	   3.06		3.11		 1.90</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
